      title: "Purpose",
      severity: "",
      maxPenalty: "",
      summary: "The purpose of the youth custody and supervision system is to protect society by carrying out sentences through the safe, fair and humane custody and supervision of young persons, and to help them rehabilitate and reintegrate as law-abiding citizens through effective programs. The principles include using the least restrictive measures necessary, young persons keeping their rights except those necessarily restricted by the sentence, involving families and the public, and making custody and supervision decisions in a forthright, fair and timely manner.",
